  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Libya - Flash Appeal, revised May 2011,UNHCR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Libyen - blixtappell, reviderad maj 2011, UNHCR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FNs blixtappell har reviderats maj 2011 f&#xf6;r krisen i Libyen.           Den reviderade appellen fokuserar bl.a. p&#xe5; skydd, och utsatta Libyer i Libyen samt de som flytt till granl&#xe4;nder, inklusive                 tredjelandsmedborgare. Sida finansierar UNHCR, UNICEF och Islamic     Relief Sverige.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Flash Appeal has been revised May 2011 for the crisis in Libya.    The revised appeal focuses on protection for vulnerable population in Libya and those, including TCNs whom have fled to neighboring         countries. Sida finances UNHCR, UNICEF and Islamic Relief Sweden.</narrative>
  </description>
